    "description": "Covers stain application, sanding sealer, and clear topcoat for stair railing systems (handrails, balusters, newel posts) in new construction. Combined spec with coating_type dimension. Dual UOM: railing=LF, balusters=EA, newels=EA. Stain phase includes wipe step for all methods. Baluster_count is the dominant labor driver. Spray is practical for spindle work. Context prefix RLST avoids collision with paint counterpart SF_STAIR_RAILING_NC.",
